1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,273
Green manure is a quick growing crop, usually a legume like dhaincha or sunn hemp, grown in the field and then ploughed back into the same soil while still green.

2
00:00:10,273 --> 00:00:20,052
A good dhaincha crop adds sixty to ninety kilograms of nitrogen per hectare, plus organic matter that improves the soil's structure and water holding.

